#: pervius/ui/window.py:3469
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"The system firewall rules will stay active if you quit without disarming. "
"That keeps traffic blocked outside the VPN, but you may need the pervius-"
"killswitch command to disarm later. {0}"
msgstr ""
"Les règles du pare-feu système resteront actives si vous quittez sans "
"désarmer. Le trafic hors VPN restera ainsi bloqué, mais vous devrez peut-"
"être utiliser la commande pervius-killswitch pour désarmer plus tard. {0}"

